;    0: TWdLink(count=4817, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜山頂.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\ザッハ外観.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Inside, as you'd expect, the burnt smell was everywhere I went.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I came out of Zahha, I found myself taking a deep breath without thinking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even this air, mixed with spores, felt fresh and gave me a little energy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Perhaps because the petals were falling a little less heavily, the cold was easing too.<PG>
Besides, you could call this deep breathing a defensive instinct, a way to pull my mind away from what I'd just witnessed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Watching closely and filming as a human body melted: thinking about it again, it's a ghastly thing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm breathing deep to forget it.<PG>
Now, I'd better meet up with <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> soon.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Zahha had lots of preserved food in restaurant-size packs, so this should make a nice gift to bring back, too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック2.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
That sound again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could another earthquake be coming?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that thought, I braced myself at once for the shaking.<PG>
............
{PAUSE ""}
............
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But no rumbling and no shaking came.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It had sounded in this town with no people left, so it could be some natural phenomenon, but...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "0" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "0" "0" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\死神手ぶら灰.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\ザッハ外観.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "0" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "800" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
............?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just now, I thought I saw something in the distance...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't tell whether it was a person or a car, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could a survey team have come?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, the survey team isn't supposed to come until tomorrow.<PG>
No mammal, humans included, could possibly survive here, so a big snake, or a bird flying low...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without thinking, I looked at the power lines strung from a utility pole.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\すずめ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Three sparrows were preening, as if they hadn't noticed this bizarre scenery.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Birds, it seemed, really could survive, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, what I'd seen earlier was a shadow far too big for a sparrow.
{STOPSND "SE2" "5000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\渦巻くシナプス.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
Maybe I'll look into it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If by some chance it's a person, we might work together and come up with a way to escape from here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We have plenty of food, so the more allies the better.<PG>
My arms were full of the food and supplies I'd gotten at Zahha.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still hauling my big load like a housewife on her way home from shopping, I headed toward where the shadow had been.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Where had it gone?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had I been seeing things?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............
{PAUSE ""}
No... it seemed I hadn't been seeing things after all.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\足跡.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
There were footprints.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
These piled-up petals apparently melted into goo as time passed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So stepping on them left clear footprints.<PG>
One person's footprints, clearly human by the look of them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I follow them, I'm sure to catch up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Judging by the stride, whoever made them is walking, not running.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Should I follow the footprints, or...<PG>
Or deliberately trace them backward?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I'd know where this person came from.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was still time before we were to meet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The garage of a nearby house gaped open.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I left the things from Zahha there and went after the source of the footprints.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\walk-snow2.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\元木市遠景.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Was there really any human out here?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was so little sign of anyone that I had to wonder.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But this line of footprints showed a person had certainly been here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It would take a while yet for the falling petals to hide these footprints.<PG>
As I followed them, I noticed something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The footprints clearly led toward Central Park.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Central Park, where that goshinboku stands―
{PAUSE ""}
the place where <STYLE ID="2">Ryoji-kun's</STYLE> body was left lying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Central Park, where <STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> also died and <STYLE ID="2">Ryoji-kun</STYLE> was found, is a place full of memories for me, in the worst sense.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\中央公園\遠景.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\中央公園\御神木.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "222" "グラフィック\背景\中央公園素材\中央公園フェンス.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Just as I thought.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The footprints came out of Central Park.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n222\r\n4\r\n1500\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n222\r\n4\r\n1500\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A gigantic cherry tree had grown out of Central Park, and almost the entire park was taken up by that one tree.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This cherry tree must have been 100 meters across.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was strikingly tall, too, compared to the other cherries.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The biggest cherry tree―no, should I call it a mushroom?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, this tree...<PG>
Would it be that goshinboku of Central Park?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The goshinboku where <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE> balloon got caught, and <STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> climbed up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Seeing this tree, tied to us in so many ways, grown bigger than anything else in Motoki City, I even caught myself suspecting it had fed on our bad memories and fattened itself this far.<PG>
Well, none of that matters right now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
More importantly, where the footprints came from―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n222\r\n4\r\n192\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n111\r\n4\r\n-814\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-306\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n222\r\n4\r\n192\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n111\r\n4\r\n-814\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-306\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Wait...<PG>
The footprints stopped.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They broke off right at the base of the goshinboku.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Above the roots, the branches formed <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ひさし">eaves</STYLE>, so no petals had piled up there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So at the very least, whoever left the footprints had come along the roots of this goshinboku.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I stepped off the piled petals onto the goshinboku's roots as well and walked all the way around the tree.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There have to be footprints somewhere else.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
............
{PAUSE ""}
............
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Strange.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The only footprints around the goshinboku were the ones I'd followed and my own.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There absolutely must be footprints left leading to this goshinboku.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One possibility: whoever left them spent the night at the foot of the goshinboku, and the falling petals buried the footprints in the meantime.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or else that person welled up out of this cherry tree.<PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\警笛とざわめき_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
When my thoughts got that far, goosebumps rose all over my body.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if that person had spent the night here, why stay out here instead of going indoors?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Last night had been especially cold.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In an emergency like this, being so scrupulous as to enter nowhere but your own home...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\walk-snow2早い.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,111,222" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I hurried back to the garage where I'd left my things.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was certain now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whoever left these footprints was no ordinary human.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hadn't found any vehicle used to get here, either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, the owner of the footprints was a Droga carrier too.<PG>
I collected my things from the garage and hurried toward the building.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This city has nowhere to escape to, but for now, that's the only place I have to go back to.<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションエレベーター.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"You're late. Were you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I walked into the building's lobby, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> was waiting in front of the elevator.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Lots of supplies had been set down in front of the elevator.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yes, I'm fine. But I saw all sorts of strange things... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">We'd better report to </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> quickly."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay, let's hurry back."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\エレベーター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
We loaded the supplies into the elevator and headed for the top floor.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, did you go to Zahha?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Huh? Yes, I did."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That bag's a Zahha takeout bag. It just took me back a little."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"You haven't been lately?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No... since </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> disappeared, I haven't really felt like going. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That place has a lot of memories of </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, too."</STYLE><PG>
I used to go to Zahha now and then too, back in the day.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Each of us had our own memories there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a family restaurant that opened around when <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> started elementary school, and for the people of Motoki-cho, still very much the countryside back then, it was a stylish place with a strong big-city feel.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And now that place, too, had become <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="はいきょ">ruins</STYLE> full of corpses and scorch marks.
{STOPSND "SE" "500" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションドア.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンション玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm hooome."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Heave-ho..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We passed the supplies we'd set down in the hallway into the entryway, bucket-brigade style.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\グラスパイン.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島あいさつ32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Thank you for all your hard work!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE> greeted us cheerfully.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now that it was settled we'd be staying with her for a while, her anxiety must have eased somewhat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Seeing <STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan's</STYLE> face like that, I felt a little calmer too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I brought a whole lot."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島考える32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"So much... Wasn't that hard?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm fine! It was dark inside the supermarket, though, so I could only grab what was near the entrance."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> carried an armful of things off to the living room.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, did you get the video?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yes, I got it. Here you go."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Thank you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I handed the phone to <STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But instead of watching it right away, she started sorting the supplies.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed she meant to put things away first and watch it after.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Okay, that's mostly put away.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Haah, I haven't done heavy lifting in ages..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> sat down on the sofa and wiped off her sweat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Thanks for your hard work. I'll make some tea now."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\ジャスミンティー.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
This time it was jasmine tea.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd pictured <STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE> as quantity over quality, anything as long as it's edible, but what she served today was quite refined.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE> had eaten only one portion of curry, too, and it was a surprise she even had a drink this stylish.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Oh, shoot..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"What's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"No, it's just, you went to the trouble of bringing paper cups and all, and I used the ceramic ones..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Once isn't going to matter."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Nngh... Erina Goto, genius girl, caught off guard..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You're not really 'girl' age anymore. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe early-onset dementia is setting in?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Wha...! That's cruel!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Leaving my <STYLE ID="1">daughters</STYLE> to their talk about age, I sipped my jasmine tea.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Haah, that warms me up..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, is jasmine tea all right for you? Some people don't like it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yes, it smells lovely. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I just thought this sort of thing isn't very </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Ha! I think so too!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Up to now it's been all about lots of tasty food at meals, but apple tea and jasmine tea aren't that kind of thing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I enjoy them as a separate genre from eating!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Oh? But you only had one portion of curry earlier too, didn't you?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hmm... well, at a time like this, I figure there's no need to eat wastefully."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Eat wastefully..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I'm getting the nutrients I need, at least, so this is plenty!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"If you say so... but don't you get hungry?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"I don't really get hungry, or full, all that much... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">So it's not like I'm inconvenienced if I don't eat a ton, or something..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> body really is a mystery... On a par with this disaster..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"That's going too far..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> stomach looks like it'd be </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="がい">worth</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> researching, too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"That much...?"</STYLE><PG>
And so on, as talk about things that didn't matter right now flew back and forth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's been a long time since I've had talk like this.<PG>
I'd actually meant to tell them first about the figure I'd seen and the melting body, but it felt like that would ruin this time, so I decided to hold off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Teatime will be over soon enough, and there's surely no need to rush that much.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Times like these are exactly when I have to treasure moments like this.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I guess they don't serve jasmine tea in prison?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"No, no! The most you get is tea in a carton or coffee milk."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Only cold stuff?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Right. The only hot drink is bancha."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Some people say prison's nice because you get to live a regular, orderly life. What do you think?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"I think it depends on the person. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Some people get out with nowhere to go and reoffend on purpose to go back, and some return to normal life so they never go back again. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I don't want to go back. An orderly life under total surveillance has nothing fun about it at all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">It's because life is a little messy that getting lots of sleep now and then can feel like happiness."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"And above all, there's no freedom. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">You can never leave the same place, and with a life sentence especially, there's no guarantee you'll get out alive. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I hear people about to work themselves to death are envious of it, but that's only because their company has brainwashed them. There are any number of ways to escape..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Coming from you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, that's heavy..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"It's not an experience most people get..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"In prison, the only things they guarantee are your life and your health. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">If someone thinks that alone is enough, I'd say prison suits them. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">But for anyone who wants some ups and downs or excitement in life, it's hell. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Getting used to the discipline is hard at first, but once you're used to it, it's the same life every single day. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">It's like... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">you're being kept, like an animal. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">It's a punishment, so of course it's supposed to feel unpleasant."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"That's intense..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had I said too much?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Talking like that, maybe I came across as someone who'd found enlightenment in prison...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't deny it had come off as condescending.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"W-well, anyway, it was a dull life where nothing ever changed, so you won't get any more interesting stories out of me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I... I really am glad you came back, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't want you to go anywhere ever again..."</STYLE><PG>
Ever since that business on April 8, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> had suddenly been thrown out into society all alone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE> and my parents must have helped, but having her life change so completely must have been an enormous strain.<PG>
Even so, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> has lived bravely for 15 years.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> who deserves a chance to breathe now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And for that, I have to get the two of them out safely, no matter what.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Come on, come on! Let's drop the gloomy talk!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　With it this gloomy outside, if we're like this too, it's hopeless!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, you're right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, thank you for the tea. It was delicious."</STYLE>
